  "notes": [
    "3.3 V is within the IM69D128S operating range; published current and acoustic performance are mostly characterized at 1.8 V. Measure 3.3 V results.",
    "GPIO allocation comes from the master sheet. Do not drive signals when their receiving block is unpowered.",
    "Exact footprints are not generated here. Audit package orientation, acoustic hole and exposed-pad numbering.",
    "Initial GPIO sequence: AMP_ENABLE low, PDM_CLK low. Start I2S and then enable the amplifier for playback; ramp data down before disabling.",
    "Provision 1 mA per microphone at 3.3 V and 0.5 A audio-branch transient capacity for the design budget. These are allocations, not measured consumption."
  ],
